<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="de">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Wöchentliche Verkaufsprognose - KW {{forecastWeek}} {{year}}</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: #333;
            max-width: 900px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 20px;
        }
        .header {
            background-color: #20c997;
            color: white;
            padding: 25px;
            border-radius: 5px;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .content {
            background-color: #f8f9fa;
            padding: 20px;
            border-radius: 5px;
            margin: 20px 0;
        }
        .kpi-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr));
            gap: 15px;
            margin: 20px 0;
        }
        .kpi-box {
            background-color: white;
            padding: 20px;
            border-radius: 5px;
            border-left: 4px solid #20c997;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .kpi-number {
            font-size: 24px;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #20c997;
        }
        .kpi-label {
            font-size: 14px;
            color: #666;
            margin-top: 5px;
        }
        .confidence {
            font-size: 12px;
            margin-top: 5px;
            font-weight: bold;
        }
        .confidence-high { color: #28a745; }
        .confidence-medium { color: #ffc107; }
        .confidence-low { color: #dc3545; }
        .table {
            width: 100%;
            border-collapse: collapse;
            margin: 15px 0;
            background-color: white;
        }
        .table th,
        .table td {
            border: 1px solid #ddd;
            padding: 10px;
            text-align: left;
        }
        .table th {
            background-color: #20c997;
            color: white;
        }
        .forecast-high {
            background-color: #d1ecf1 !important;
            font-weight: bold;
        }
        .forecast-medium {
            background-color: #fff3cd !important;
        }
        .forecast-low {
            background-color: #f8d7da !important;
        }
        .footer {
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 12px;
            color: #666;
            margin-top: 30px;
            padding-top: 20px;
            border-top: 1px solid #eee;
        }
        .section {
            background-color: white;
            padding: 20px;
            border-radius: 5px;
            margin: 15px 0;
        }
        .weather-info {
            background-color: #e7f3ff;
            padding: 15px;
            border-radius: 5px;
            border-left: 4px solid #007bff;
            margin: 15px 0;
        }
        .alert {
            padding: 15px;
            border-radius: 5px;
            margin: 15px 0;
        }
        .alert-info {
            background-color: #d1ecf1;
            border: 1px solid #bee5eb;
            color: #0c5460;
        }
        .alert-warning {
            background-color: #fff3cd;
            border: 1px solid #ffeaa7;
            color: #856404;
        }
        .progress-bar {
            width: 100%;
            height: 20px;
            background-color: #e9ecef;
            border-radius: 10px;
            overflow: hidden;
            margin: 5px 0;
        }
        .progress-fill {
            height: 100%;
            background-color: #20c997;
            transition: width 0.3s ease;
        }
        .trend-up { color: #28a745; font-weight: bold; }
        .trend-down { color: #dc3545; font-weight: bold; }
        .trend-stable { color: #6c757d; }
        .accuracy-indicator {
            display: inline-block;
            width: 12px;
            height: 12px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            margin-right: 5px;
        }
        .accuracy-high { background-color: #28a745; }
        .accuracy-medium { background-color: #ffc107; }
        .accuracy-low { background-color: #dc3545; }
        .daily-forecast {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(7, 1fr);
            gap: 10px;
            margin: 15px 0;
        }
        .day-forecast {
            background-color: #f8f9fa;
            padding: 15px;
            border-radius: 5px;
            text-align: center;
            border: 1px solid #dee2e6;
        }
        .day-forecast.weekend {
            background-color: #fff3cd;
            border-color: #ffc107;
        }
        .day-forecast.holiday {
            background-color: #f8d7da;
            border-color: #dc3545;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="header">
        <h1>🔮 Wöchentliche Verkaufsprognose</h1>
        <p>KW {{forecastWeek}} {{year}} ({{formatDate startDate "DD.MM."}} - {{formatDate endDate "DD.MM.YYYY"}})</p>
        <p>Basierend auf KI-Analyse und historischen Daten</p>
    </div>

    <div class="content">
        <div class="kpi-grid">
            <div class="kpi-box">
                <div class="kpi-number">{{forecastRevenue}} €</div>
                <div class="kpi-label">Prognostizierter Umsatz</div>
                <div class="confidence confidence-{{#if (gte revenueConfidence 80)}}high{{else if (gte revenueConfidence 60)}}medium{{else}}low{{/if}}">
                    {{revenueConfidence}}% Konfidenz
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="kpi-box">
                <div class="kpi-number">{{forecastTransactions}}</div>
                <div class="kpi-label">Erwartete Transaktionen</div>
                <div class="confidence confidence-{{#if (gte transactionConfidence 80)}}high{{else if (gte transactionConfidence 60)}}medium{{else}}low{{/if}}">
                    {{transactionConfidence}}% Konfidenz
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="kpi-box">
                <div class="kpi-number {{#if (gt forecastChange 0)}}trend-up{{else if (lt forecastChange 0)}}trend-down{{else}}trend-stable{{/if}}">
                    {{#if (gt forecastChange 0)}}+{{/if}}{{forecastChange}}%
                </div>
                <div class="kpi-label">Veränderung vs. Vorwoche</div>
                <div class="confidence neutral">
                    {{#if (gt forecastChange 5)}}Starkes Wachstum erwartet{{else if (gt forecastChange 0)}}Moderates Wachstum{{else if (lt forecastChange -5)}}Starker Rückgang{{else if (lt forecastChange 0)}}Leichter Rückgang{{else}}Stabile Entwicklung{{/if}}
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="kpi-box">
                <div class="kpi-number">{{modelAccuracy}}%</div>
                <div class="kpi-label">Modell-Genauigkeit</div>
                <div class="confidence confidence-{{#if (gte modelAccuracy 85)}}high{{else if (gte modelAccuracy 70)}}medium{{else}}low{{/if}}">
                    Basis: {{historicalDataPoints}} Datenpunkte
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        {{#if weatherInfluence}}
        <div class="weather-info">
            <h4>🌤️ Wettereinfluss auf die Prognose:</h4>
            <p><strong>Wettervorhersage:</strong> {{weather.description}}</p>
            <p><strong>Temperatur:</strong> {{weather.avgTemp}}°C (Min: {{weather.minTemp}}°C, Max: {{weather.maxTemp}}°C)</p>
            <p><strong>Niederschlag:</strong> {{weather.precipitation}}mm</p>
            <p><strong>Einfluss auf Verkäufe:</strong> 
                <span class="{{#if (gt weather.impact 0)}}trend-up{{else if (lt weather.impact 0)}}trend-down{{else}}trend-stable{{/if}}">
                    {{#if (gt weather.impact 0)}}+{{weather.impact}}% (Förderlich){{else if (lt weather.impact 0)}}{{weather.impact}}% (Hemmend){{else}}Neutral{{/if}}
                </span>
            </p>
        </div>
        {{/if}}

        <div class="section">
            <h3>📅 Tägliche Prognose</h3>
            <div class="daily-forecast">
                {{#each dailyForecast}}
                <div class="day-forecast {{#if isWeekend}}weekend{{/if}} {{#if isHoliday}}holiday{{/if}}">
                    <div style="font-weight: bold;">{{dayName}}</div>
                    <div style="font-size: 14px; color: #666;">{{formatDate date "DD.MM."}}</div>
                    {{#if isHoliday}}
                    <div style="font-size: 12px; color: #dc3545; margin: 5px 0;">🎉 {{holidayName}}</div>
                    {{/if}}
                    <div style="font-size: 18px; font-weight: bold; color: #20c997; margin: 5px 0;">{{forecastRevenue}} €</div>
                    <div style="font-size: 12px;">{{forecastTransactions}} Trans.</div>
                    <div style="font-size: 10px; color: #666;">±{{variance}}%</div>
                </div>
                {{/each}}
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="section">
            <h3>🏪 Standort-Prognosen (Top 10)</h3>
            <table class="table">
                <thead>
                    <tr>
                        <th>Standort</th>
                        <th>Prognose</th>
                        <th>Konfidenz</th>
                        <th>Vs. Vorwoche</th>
                        <th>Risikofaktoren</th>
                        <th>Empfehlung</th>
                    </tr>
                </thead>
                <tbody>
                    {{#each locationForecasts}}
                    <tr class="{{#if (gte confidence 80)}}forecast-high{{else if (gte confidence 60)}}forecast-medium{{else}}forecast-low{{/if}}">
                        <td>{{locationName}}</td>
                        <td>{{forecastRevenue}} €</td>
                        <td>
                            <span class="accuracy-indicator accuracy-{{#if (gte confidence 80)}}high{{else if (gte confidence 60)}}medium{{else}}low{{/if}}"></span>
                            {{confidence}}%
                        </td>
                        <td class="{{#if (gt change 0)}}trend-up{{else if (lt change 0)}}trend-down{{else}}trend-stable{{/if}}">
                            {{#if (gt change 0)}}+{{/if}}{{change}}%
                        </td>
                        <td>
                            {{#if riskFactors}}
                                {{#each riskFactors}}
                                    <span style="font-size: 11px;">{{this}}</span><br>
                                {{/each}}
                            {{else}}
                                ✅ Gering
                            {{/if}}
                        </td>
                        <td>
                            {{#if (gte confidence 80)}}
                                ✅ Standard-Befüllung
                            {{else if (gte confidence 60)}}
                                ⚠️ Vorsichtige Befüllung
                            {{else}}
                                🔍 Engmaschige Überwachung
                            {{/if}}
                        </td>
                    </tr>
                    {{/each}}
                </tbody>
            </table>
        </div>

        <div class="section">
            <h3>📦 Produkt-Nachfrage-Prognose</h3>
            <table class="table">
                <thead>
                    <tr>
                        <th>Produkt</th>
                        <th>Prognostizierte Menge</th>
                        <th>Umsatzprognose</th>
                        <th>Trend</th>
                        <th>Saisonalität</th>
                        <th>Lagerempfehlung</th>
                    </tr>
                </thead>
                <tbody>
                    {{#each productForecasts}}
                    <tr>
                        <td>{{productName}}</td>
                        <td>{{forecastQuantity}} Stk.</td>
                        <td>{{forecastRevenue}} €</td>
                        <td class="{{#if (gt trend 0)}}trend-up{{else if (lt trend 0)}}trend-down{{else}}trend-stable{{/if}}">
                            {{#if (gt trend 0)}}📈 +{{trend}}%{{else if (lt trend 0)}}📉 {{trend}}%{{else}}➡️ Stabil{{/if}}
                        </td>
                        <td>
                            {{#if seasonalFactor}}
                                {{#if (gt seasonalFactor 1.1)}}
                                    🔥 Saisonhoch
                                {{else if (lt seasonalFactor 0.9)}}
                                    ❄️ Saisontief
                                {{else}}
                                    📊 Normal
                                {{/if}}
                            {{else}}
                                📊 Normal
                            {{/if}}
                        </td>
                        <td>
                            {{#if (gt trend 10)}}
                                📈 Bestand erhöhen
                            {{else if (lt trend -10)}}
                                📉 Bestand reduzieren
                            {{else}}
                                ➡️ Aktueller Bestand OK
                            {{/if}}
                        </td>
                    </tr>
                    {{/each}}
                </tbody>
            </table>
        </div>

        <div class="section">
            <h3>🎯 Modell-Performance und Genauigkeit</h3>
            <table class="table">
                <thead>
                    <tr>
                        <th>Zeitraum</th>
                        <th>Prognose</th>
                        <th>Ist-Wert</th>
                        <th>Abweichung</th>
                        <th>Genauigkeit</th>
                    </tr>
                </thead>
                <tbody>
                    {{#each accuracyHistory}}
                    <tr>
                        <td>KW {{weekNumber}}</td>
                        <td>{{forecast}} €</td>
                        <td>{{actual}} €</td>
                        <td class="{{#if (gt deviation 0)}}trend-up{{else if (lt deviation 0)}}trend-down{{else}}trend-stable{{/if}}">
                            {{#if (gt deviation 0)}}+{{/if}}{{deviation}}%
                        </td>
                        <td>
                            {{accuracy}}%
                            <div class="progress-bar">
                                <div class="progress-fill" style="width: {{accuracy}}%;"></div>
                            </div>
                        </td>
                    </tr>
                    {{/each}}
                </tbody>
            </table>
        </div>

        {{#if specialEvents}}
        <div class="alert alert-info">
            <h4>🎪 Besondere Ereignisse in der Prognosewoche:</h4>
            <ul>
                {{#each specialEvents}}
                <li><strong>{{date}}:</strong> {{event}} - Erwarteter Einfluss: {{impact}}</li>
                {{/each}}
            </ul>
        </div>
        {{/if}}

        {{#if alerts}}
        <div class="alert alert-warning">
            <h4>⚠️ Wichtige Hinweise zur Prognose:</h4>
            <ul>
                {{#each alerts}}
                <li>{{this}}</li>
                {{/each}}
            </ul>
        </div>
        {{/if}}

        <div class="section">
            <h3>📊 Prognose-Einflussfaktoren</h3>
            <table class="table">
                <thead>
                    <tr>
                        <th>Faktor</th>
                        <th>Gewichtung</th>
                        <th>Aktueller Wert</th>
                        <th>Einfluss</th>
                        <th>Kommentar</th>
                    </tr>
                </thead>
                <tbody>
                    {{#each influenceFactors}}
                    <tr>
                        <td>{{factorName}}</td>
                        <td>{{weight}}%</td>
                        <td>{{currentValue}}</td>
                        <td class="{{#if (gt influence 0)}}trend-up{{else if (lt influence 0)}}trend-down{{else}}trend-stable{{/if}}">
                            {{#if (gt influence 0)}}+{{/if}}{{influence}}%
                        </td>
                        <td>{{comment}}</td>
                    </tr>
                    {{/each}}
                </tbody>
            </table>
        </div>

        {{#if recommendations}}
        <div class="section" style="border-left: 4px solid #20c997;">
            <h3>💡 Handlungsempfehlungen</h3>
            
            {{#if recommendations.immediate}}
            <div class="alert alert-warning">
                <h4>🚨 Sofortige Maßnahmen:</h4>
                <ul>
                    {{#each recommendations.immediate}}
                    <li><strong>{{this}}</strong></li>
                    {{/each}}
                </ul>
            </div>
            {{/if}}

            {{#if recommendations.restocking}}
            <h4>📦 Nachfüll-Empfehlungen:</h4>
            <ul>
                {{#each recommendations.restocking}}
                <li>{{this}}</li>
                {{/each}}
            </ul>
            {{/if}}

            {{#if recommendations.strategic}}
            <h4>🎯 Strategische Empfehlungen:</h4>
            <ul>
                {{#each recommendations.strategic}}
                <li>{{this}}</li>
                {{/each}}
            </ul>
            {{/if}}
        </div>
        {{/if}}

        <div class="section">
            <h3>📈 Konfidenzintervall</h3>
            <p><strong>Optimistisches Szenario (90%):</strong> {{optimisticRevenue}} €</p>
            <p><strong>Realistisches Szenario (50%):</strong> {{realisticRevenue}} €</p>
            <p><strong>Pessimistisches Szenario (10%):</strong> {{pessimisticRevenue}} €</p>
            <p><strong>Standardabweichung:</strong> ±{{standardDeviation}} €</p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="footer">
        <p>Diese Prognose wurde automatisch vom Proviantomat-KI-System generiert.</p>
        <p>Prognosezeitraum: KW {{forecastWeek}} {{year}} ({{formatDate startDate "DD.MM.YYYY"}} - {{formatDate endDate "DD.MM.YYYY"}})</p>
        <p>Modell: Prophet + Machine Learning | Trainingsdaten: {{trainingDataPoints}} Wochen</p>
        <p>Generiert am: {{formatDate sentAt "DD.MM.YYYY HH:mm"}} (Europe/Berlin)</p>
    </div>
</body>
</html>